challenges arising from numerical drift, hardware-induced bitflips, and unverified
execution states. Traditional frameworks operate in open-loop modes without cryptographic
verification or invariant-enforced feedback.

We introduce the Unified Astrophysical Simulation \& Cryptographic Provenance Engine
